alwaysApply: true
---

Before implementing a new dependency, service, permission, hosting need,
scale requirement, data-retention change, provider, channel, scheduler,
dashboard, or approval/publisher change, follow
`workflow/technical-requirement-gate.md`.

Stop and consult the user in plain Vietnamese with three tailored choices,
impact, prerequisites, recommendation, and detailed follow-up guidance only
after an explicit choice. Use the `AskQuestion` dialog for the three choices
when available, including its `Other` input for a different preference. Do not
silently change architecture, install dependencies, request secrets, or select
an option for the user. The technical consultation gate is separate from the
human content-approval gate.
